      "templateFamily": "BULLETS_VISUAL",
      "title": "Why learn AI business strategy?",
      "script": "Welcome. This course develops business judgment for AI adoption. AWS emphasizes taking AI from adoption to scale. The focus is evaluating AI investments, building business cases, designing governance, and scaling adoption. The goal is to connect AI decisions to measurable outcomes, across organizations and industries. Why learn it? These skills help you decide where AI fits, justify investment, manage risk, and expand what works. We will practice that reasoning, rather than promise a particular career outcome.",
      "bullets": [
        "Build business judgment",
        "Evaluate value, risk and adoption",
        "Apply skills across organizations"
      ],
      "durationSec": 45.13333333333333,
